# Rust
/target
/.build-temp/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig

# Original (copyrighted) game data — never commit
*.MAP
*.001
*.SCR
RESOURCE.*
SCRANTIC.*
data/
# The release-package placeholder is documentation, not game data.
!/packaging/
!/packaging/windows/
!/packaging/windows/data/
!/packaging/windows/data/PUT-ORIGINAL-FILES-HERE.txt
assets-original/
# This private repository deliberately includes the owned test resource set so
# the Castaway Continuum v1.0.0 embedded Windows build is reproducible.
!/test-original-data/
releases/*.exe
# Reference implementations (third-party) are kept only locally, never committed —
# clone the upstreams yourself (see docs/knowledge-base/06-projetos-de-referencia.md).
# dist.zip (the encrypted test bundle) is copyrighted game data — never commit it.
/repos/
/dist.zip

